  "title": "Jagged Tangy Portuguese Chicken Skewers",
  "description": "A tangy and flavorful Portuguese dish featuring pineapple chunks and a mirepoix base, perfect for a post-workout meal. This dish is easy to make and can be prepared in under an hour.",
