  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chicken to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the chicken, pineapple chunks, onion, carrots, and celery onto skewers.",
    "Brush the skewers with the remaining marinade.",
    "Grill the skewers for 10-12 minutes, or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy.",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley or cilantro, if desired."
